## Existing tooling and source-check provenance

Reuse the delivered schema-2 reports, family work counters, causal IDs, hardware/glyph/edit fixtures and frozen v2 case definitions. Their implementation and the latest measured outcomes are in 00; they are not further rebuild tasks. V1 and v2 are different workloads. That historical bundle declared 43 case/phases. Later suite identities and complete observations are in Overhaul.md; keep private and physical scopes distinct.

Twenty-two standard-library tooling tests passed in Niri. The local combined native source/executable recheck was interrupted when `target/` disappeared; the later CI-built optimized, source-matched executables are now verified and have actually run in Park. Later optimized results supersede this old visit. Remaining source-batch and physical acceptance is in Overhaul.md; this is not a pending build request.

